# Issue 5

## Password confusion ("Password Spaghetti")

Several different passwords existed simultaneously:

* Ubuntu
* UniFi Portal
* MongoDB
* SSH
* pfSense
* KeePass
* OpenAI-generated credentials

This created uncertainty during troubleshooting.

### Resolution

Created a single source of truth using KeePass.

Every infrastructure password now stored immediately after creation.

