# Issue 6

## Incorrect Ubuntu timezone

### Symptoms

UniFi login times differed by four hours.

Ubuntu reported:

```
UTC
```

instead of

```
America/New_York
```

### Resolution

```
sudo timedatectl set-timezone America/New_York
```

Verified:

```
timedatectl
```

Now reports:

```
System clock synchronized: yes
NTP service: active
Time zone: America/New_York
```

